      "EFFECTIVE DATE 1st FEBRUARY, 1956\nQANTAS\nTIMETABLE\nSCHEDULES \u0026 FARES\nSUPER CONSTELLATION SERVICE\nCONTINENTS\nLINKING\nQANTAS EMPIRE AIRWAYS",
